sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as UserGroupController
    participant UG as UserGroupModule
    participant Impact as ImpactAnalyzer
    participant Match as MatchingEngine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>FE: Edit Matching Criteria
    FE->>API: Preview criteria change

    API->>Impact: estimate old vs new membership
    Impact->>Match: Evaluate proposed rule
    Match->>DB: Query tenant Employee References
    DB-->>Match: Matching population
    Match-->>Impact: Proposed membership

    Impact->>DB: Read current membership
    DB-->>Impact: Current membership

    Impact-->>API: affected / gain / loss
    API-->>FE: Show impact

    Admin->>FE: Confirm
    FE->>API: Save criteria

    API->>UG: updateMatchingCriteria()
    UG->>DB: Update rule
    UG->>DB: Increment configuration version
    UG-->>API: PENDING
    API-->>FE: Pending Sync
